msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Kaikki holvissa salataan uudelleen uudella salasanalla. Aiemmin tehdyt "
"varmuuskopiot avautuvat edelleen salasanalla, jolla ne tehtiin."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Kaikki synkronissa"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Kaikki palaa siihen tilaan, jossa se oli kopion tekohetkellä, liitteet ja "
"salasanahistoria mukaan lukien. Myöhemmin luodut merkinnät katoavat. "
"Nykyinen holvi säilytetään tiedostona sen vieressä."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Kaikki oli jo synkronoitu"

msgid "Export complete"
msgstr "Vienti valmis"

msgid "Export failed"
msgstr "Vienti epäonnistui"

msgid "Export to KeePass"
